abstract: >-
  A treatise presenting the Dialectical Cognition Framework (DCF)—a methodology
  for human-AI collaboration that positions LLMs as thinking mirrors rather than
  answer machines. The framework synthesizes Socratic philosophy, cognitive science,
  and AI engineering to provide structured approaches for engaging with conversational
  and agentic AI systems.
